oke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></span></div></button></div></div></div><div data-rid="94234c15-bf97-4d1e-8a84-9fc087551f89" class="r-1czw8zx"><div data-rid="83a5dca0-464b-41c9-bd40-a1a4fa96ce19" class="r-1qmafl0"><div data-rid="7dfe769e-1630-479f-ac9b-807acf73803a" class="r-5t1oba alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>FAQ</p></span></div><div data-rid="a058f11d-d738-41fd-b0bc-8038bc53610e" class="r-yqq2bn" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c15ea9dd-2c88-4856-9a72-b14d5836e32e" class="r-pm5ifj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="22a3d305-f299-4e31-84f5-beeb910ba270" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-fh9y9c"><div data-rid="c667be92-64cb-4f68-a171-2792b63f1fd9" class="r-ss3bmf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is Dash Feel Good Rewards?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6ebe9749-048c-4f3a-b3b3-99e5d882cbaa" class="r-1b28q8m"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rrj2:"><div data-rid="bd633dd9-e750-4d3e-9f5c-41779aef81b3" class="r-1ryprz"><div data-rid="f6b63a7d-884d-4ab9-9c06-56396576b931" class="r-1rg7bhb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Feel Good Rewards is the Dash warranty and rewards program, extending the warranty on your Dash products up to 2 years total. Through <a href="http://ByDash.com">ByDash.com</a>, you can also earn and save points with every purchase towards exclusive rewards for members.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3effb22f-e53c-459b-94e4-9340c1832dea" class="r-1gbgtnl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d347cdec-4c6d-4657-b061-4c6719e2fc2b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1hkmvpn"><div data-rid="1cc29800-9b61-4ee8-9d4c-c228cccb1b17" class="r-1utuff6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Who can join the program?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b5b6b7ec-fda4-48f0-9b23-b2eb5f7941c4" class="r-norygt"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1bj2:"><div data-rid="b4f7bcb0-55c6-4f8a-9deb-e7b0589af178" class="r-chgwyj"><div data-rid="87cd471b-5b46-4500-9f9e-3ca0d5f44c36" class="r-zyoyqi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Anyone who would like to create an account on <a href="http://ByDash.com">ByDash.com</a> can join Feel Good Rewards and earn 50 points for joining. Accounts are limited to one per person.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3f5ef755-634d-4205-8eb7-f1b39ddb2531" class="r-1rdsq5b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c39fae67-022d-40b5-a166-22a9d1b96553" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2x9qyj"><div data-rid="040085ad-ec01-487a-b3db-859238679e27" class="r-1fagc3b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I earn points?</p></span></div><div data-rid="51dc668e-c04b-428b-92f0-fcb17cb7bb73" class="r-19l97za"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1rj2:"><div data-rid="3ea4ca92-d48c-46a4-a597-f5a7396b083b" class="r-1mfgvax"><div data-rid="b5ae3e51-72a7-43ff-8ed5-4a446f86e0aa" class="r-1dy2fqw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Aside from your first 50 points for registering, you can earn points by purchasing items directly through <a href="http://ByDash.com">ByDash.com</a> or by taking another qualifying action through the <a href="http://ByDash.com">ByDash.com</a> rewards portal. Click the Earn Points button above the FAQ to learn all the ways you can earn points.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b310bb8c-1f11-4581-afaf-caf0db74af18" class="r-1lbhwfh" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c6147e63-c47f-4bff-a3c7-760e69c5bdd9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1jrgguv"><div data-rid="340f2820-72cd-474d-a08c-747321edc52a" class="r-fsckoi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I redeem points for rewards?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c29d9e36-b4b5-40af-8794-38c79f7d3abc" class="r-m8f0b9"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2bj2:"><div data-rid="6535ed51-5ba8-4824-818b-ee57792bd847" class="r-13ufs2g"><div data-rid="d670fc63-dc3c-45d1-917c-39edfd777fcb" class="r-gpxo98 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Click the Redeem Points button above the FAQ to view and redeem your available rewards.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ba9fc682-a0b0-44d8-acdc-26790cc11005" class="r-90kybr" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ce254459-1a20-4860-bd79-b82a1db38e3c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-10e58ps"><div data-rid="3065a5d6-80df-48b4-a868-3b1444d7f492" class="r-1nutqm8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What are the terms of the program?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a36ef3b9-efcc-4f4b-bca3-a613789bbea1" class="r-g0stjk"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2rj2:"><div data-rid="a97da548-c1fc-42a6-9ee3-4b85bb0ebf0d" class="r-1hn4nao"><div data-rid="6d2665ff-88b4-4595-a36a-5c5627c41e2f" class="r-urb44g alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>By joining the Program, you agree that you have read, understand and agree to be bound by the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://bydash.com/pages/dash-feel-good-rewards-loyalty-program-terms-and-conditions"><u>Dash Feel Good Rewards Loyalty Program Terms and Conditions</u></a> and by any changes or modifications we may make to those Program terms and conditions. You also agree to receive Program-related emails from us.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="88cd